note Trigger and effect: files come sorted by path, so a directory is a run of files with the same component at this depth. A FILE_ROW click queues GoTo line one; a DIRECTORY_ROW click queues ToggleDirectory. A directory is open when it is top level XOR flipped, and an open one draws its run one level deeper.

